Subject: [PATCH 08/54] =?UTF-8?q?server:=20toggle=20MTP=20s=C3=A9lectif=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?sur=20temp<=3D0.01=20(code)=20+=20force=20backend-sampling=20of?=
 =?UTF-8?q?f?=
